      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Profit-linked quantity questions add one setup step.\n\nIf a mixture sells at ₹118 with 18% profit, mixture cost is ₹100.\n\nOnly then compare ingredient costs with ₹100 to find the mixing ratio or unknown quantity.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
